    "about_item": [
      "👍𝗛𝗘𝗔𝗥 𝗠𝗢𝗥𝗘, 𝗙𝗘𝗘𝗟 𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗘 — Enjoy music, podcasts, and calls without feeling cut off from the world. These open earbuds sit outside the ear, allowing natural airflow and ambient sound while audio plays clearly. Unlike traditional headphones, this design feels lighter and more relaxed, making these boytond ultra earphones ideal for daily listening at home, walking, commuting, or casual running when you want sound without isolation",
      "👍𝗭𝗘𝗥𝗢 𝗣𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗦𝗨𝗥𝗘, 𝗔𝗟𝗟 𝗗𝗔𝗬 — Designed for long, comfortable wear, these clip on earbuds feature a small ergonomic clip structure that rests gently over the ear instead of inside it. The lightweight buds avoid pressure and ear fatigue often caused by in-ear ear buds, making these earbuds easy to wear through workdays, meetings, travel, and everyday activities where comfort matters most",
      "👍𝗖𝗥𝗬𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗟 𝗖𝗟𝗘𝗔𝗥 𝗘𝗩𝗘𝗥𝗬 𝗖𝗔𝗟𝗟 — Equipped with 16.3mm dynamic drivers designed for balanced bass, clear treble, and detailed audio performance, these earbuds deliver natural sound that makes voices easy to hear and conversations effortless to follow. Calls, podcasts, and navigation remain clear without sounding harsh, making these headphones ideal for daily multitasking, remote work, and everyday listening where clarity matters",
      "👍𝗣𝗢𝗪𝗘𝗥 𝗧𝗛𝗔𝗧 𝗡𝗘𝗩𝗘𝗥 𝗤𝗨𝗜𝗧𝗦 — Built for modern daily routines, these earbuds offer up to 10 hours of continuous playback on a single charge, with up to 40 hours of total listening time when used with the charging case. This long-lasting performance reduces charging interruptions, while the waterproof design handles sweat and light moisture, making these ultra earphones reliable for work, travel, and extended listening sessions on the go",
      "👍𝗦𝗘𝗔𝗠𝗟𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗖𝗢𝗡𝗡𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡, 𝗘𝗩𝗘𝗥𝗬 𝗧𝗜𝗠𝗘 — Enjoy smooth, reliable audio with advanced bluetooth 5.3 technology built for daily stability. These wireless bone conduction earbuds connect quickly and stay consistent across devices, including android, so switching between calls and music feels effortless. The secure clip fit keeps the buds comfortably over the ear for uninterrupted listening all day"
    ],
